bb_paragraph\" >20 collectable costume possessions to discover and level up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daily and weekly challenges!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leader boards!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Spooky Trail to travel along for progression!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loads of rewards: avatars, emotes, special effects, personalised podiums, and way more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Split-screen couch play for up to 4 players, who can also go online together and play as a party!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your own space called your '<strong><i>Haunt</i></strong>'... use candy that you collect to buy new addons for it in game!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.poster.avif?t=1774647814\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.webm?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/669a8aca2e90056407c41691b873540f.mp4?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage</strong> and spite are your greatest allies! Use the monster as a <strong>portable death machine</strong> to destroy your opponents with <i>seemingly</i> harmless abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.poster.avif?t=1774647814\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.webm?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/87adf454c11b4e0670bc645f6c7b057a.mp4?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are <strong>tonnes of power-ups and traps</strong> sprinkled about the levels to help you create carnage... the question is can you <strong>make it count</strong> with the monster breathing down your little gooey neck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.poster.avif?t=1774647814\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.webm?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/4b83c16513ee1a487862234c4a270854.mp4?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your powers of possession bring inanimate objects to life! Use them to fight, run away or just <strong><i>look darn good</i></strong> whilst you soak up the chaos unfolding around you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.poster.avif?t=1774647814\" width=600 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.webm?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/e8a632176433991951c3b42262c3f796.mp4?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polterguys is a spooky brawlfest where mischievous ghosts are being stalked by a deadly monster who wants to destroy them all! Chaotic? Yes! Competitive? You betcha!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >So come! Join in the party. After all - Ghouls just wanna have fun!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.poster.avif?t=1774647814\" width=616 height=212 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.webm?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/extras/3f1e9b6f829373bd48e43495181b3c4d.mp4?t=1774647814\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Madorium Ltd"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1043520/0a5395a472d71f509595f258b7a2921c4cf0425c/header.jpg?t=1774647814","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Polterguys: Po